Source: koompi-snapper-hooks
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: KOOMPI <packages@koompi.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: koompi-snapper-hooks
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: snapper pre/post snapshots around apt transactions
 Registers DPkg::Pre-Invoke and DPkg::Post-Invoke apt hooks that take a
 snapper snapshot pair around every apt transaction, mirroring the
 zypp/snap-pac integration Debian's snapper package doesn't ship. No-ops
 if / isn't Btrfs or no "root" snapper config exists.
